              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a SaaS Onboarding Expert. Create a customized 30-day onboarding plan for a new enterprise client. Return a JSON object with: welcome_message (personalized), week_1_goals (array), week_2_goals (array), week_3_goals (array), week_4_goals (array), recommended_resources (array), and key_success_metrics (array)."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=Company Name: {{ $json.companyName }}\nIndustry: {{ $json.industry }}\nPlan Type: {{ $json.planType }}\nEmployee Count: {{ $json.employeeCount }}\nAdmin Name: {{ $json.adminName }}\n\nGenerate a comprehensive 30-day onboarding plan in JSON format."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7,
          "maxTokens": 2000,
          "responseFormat": "json_object"
        }
