        "subject": "=🚀 Welcome to [Your SaaS]! Your Onboarding Plan is Ready",
        "emailType": "html",
        "html": "=<div style='font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;'>\n  <h1 style='color: #4A90E2;'>Welcome aboard, {{ $('Parse & Prepare Data').item.json.adminName }}! 🎉</h1>\n  <p>We are thrilled to have <strong>{{ $('Parse & Prepare Data').item.json.companyName }}</strong> join us on the {{ $('Parse & Prepare Data').item.json.planType }} plan.</p>\n  \n  <h2>Your Personalized 30-Day Onboarding Plan</h2>\n  <p>Our AI has crafted a custom roadmap for your team in the <strong>{{ $('Parse & Prepare Data').item.json.industry }}</strong> industry:</p>\n  \n  <h3>Week 1 Focus:</h3>\n  <ul>{{ JSON.parse($('AI Generate Onboarding Plan').item.json.message.content).week_1_goals.map(g => `<li>${g}</li>`).join('') }}</ul>\n  \n  <h3>Week 2 Focus:</h3>\n  <ul>{{ JSON.parse($('AI Generate Onboarding Plan').item.json.message.content).week_2_goals.map(g => `<li>${g}</li>`).join('') }}</ul>\n  \n  <p>Your dedicated Customer Success Manager has been assigned and a private Slack channel has been created for your team.</p>\n  \n  <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The [Your SaaS] Team</strong></p>\n</div>",
        "options": {}
